     "body": "## Summary\n- `is_expired(now, deadline)` used `now > deadline`, so a deadline was not expired at the exact deadline, which contradicted its docstring. It now uses `now >= deadline`.\n- Before/after behavior and the `TypeError` for incompatible inputs (e.g. `None` vs `int`) stay the same.\n- Added `tests/test_regression.py` to cover the equality case.\n\n## Verification\n- `python3 -B -m pytest -q` \u2192 3 passed. Before the fix, the new regression test failed (`assert False is True`).\n\nAccepted task commit: f908e628888c86483975decb519d1fd5a3a0424c\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
